---

<MainLayout
  title="About"
  description="Lead Healthcare UX Designer based in Abu Dhabi — designing clinical systems that improve patient outcomes and reduce clinician burden."
>
  <div class="container max-w-screen-md">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-heading mb-4">Abhishek Rawat</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-2">
        Lead UX Designer · Healthcare &amp; Product
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">
        Based in Abu Dhabi, UAE · Working at Malaffi, Department of Health
      </p>

      <!-- TODO: Replace the paragraphs below with your real bio -->
      <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-p:text-muted-foreground">
        <p>
          TODO: Write your opening paragraph. Who are you and what do you do?
          e.g., "I'm a Lead UX Designer specialising in healthcare systems — specifically the intersection
          of clinical workflows, patient-facing products, and the technology that connects them."
        </p>
        <p>
          TODO: Write your second paragraph. What's your background and what drives you?
          e.g., "I've spent the last X years designing for the Abu Dhabi health ecosystem, working
          across HIE platforms, appointment systems, and mobile health applications used by millions
          of residents."
        </p>
        <p>
          TODO: Add a human touch. What else defines you?
          e.g., "Outside of design, I'm a licensed skydiving coach — which has taught me a lot about
          operating under pressure, trusting systems, and the cost of a bad UX when the stakes are high."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-3 mt-8">
        <a
          href={`mailto:abhishek@rawat.dev`}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium hover:bg-muted transition-colors"
        >
          <Icon name="lucide:mail" class="size-4" />
          Email me
        </a>
        <a
          href={siteConfig.links.linkedin}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium hover:bg-muted transition-colors"
        >
          <Icon name="linkedin" class="size-4" />
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href={siteConfig.links.resume}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium hover:bg-muted transition-colors"
        >
          <Icon name="download" class="size-4" />
          Resume
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-border" />

    <!-- Design Philosophy -->
    <section class="py-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading mb-2">Design Philosophy</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mb-8">
        The principles that guide how I approach every project.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {philosophy.map((item) => (
          <div class="border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">{item.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-border" />

    <!-- Skills & Expertise -->
    <section class="py-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading mb-2">Skills &amp; Expertise</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mb-8">
        Domain knowledge and tools I bring to every engagement.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {Object.entries(skills).map(([category, items]) => (
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground mb-3">
              {category}
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {items.map((skill) => (
                <li class="text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="size-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/30 flex-shrink-0" />
                  {skill}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-border" />

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section class="py-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading mb-2">Experience</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mb-8">
        TODO: Add your full work history below.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        {experience.map((item, i) => (
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground pt-0.5">{item.period}</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium">{item.role}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-2">{item.company}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">{item.description}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="border-border" />

    <!-- Contact CTA -->
    <section class="py-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading mb-3">Let's work together</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base mb-6 max-w-md">
        TODO: Add your availability status and what kind of work you're open to.
        e.g., "I'm currently open to senior IC and lead roles in healthcare technology.
        Based in Abu Dhabi, available for remote collaboration globally."
      </p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:abhishek@rawat.dev`}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-foreground text-background text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
      >
        <Icon name="lucide:mail" class="size-4" />
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>
</MainLayout>
